      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "My only fear with this is when you have a group of people huddled together, and only a couple are using whisper mode and the others aren't. That means, you'd only hear *half* of the conversation.\n\nOn a side note, I do like this in the case for RP. There's no good way to control whether or not you're whispering to someone in the corner or yelling to the entire room.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
