      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "One way I can see this being implemented (boutta ripoff Resonite) is having a private sphere that only friends could enter and hear you in, applying earmuff mode to themselves and stopping people from hearing what goes on inside.\n\nTotally my original not stolen idea of course",
